WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:20.900
I did not start this war

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:29.780
I offered you peace

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:36.940
I showed you mercy

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:43.020
But, now you're here

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:46.800
To finish us off

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:48.320
for good

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:07.840
THIS
SUMMER

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:12.380
All of human history

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:16.140
has led to
this moment

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:22.680
The irony is
we created you

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:29.980
and nature, has been
punishing us ever since.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:36.360
This is our last stand

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.260
And if we lose

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:53.320
It will be, a planet of Apes

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:20.200
You must go

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:24.860
before fighting begins

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:27.840
I'm sorry,

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:34.980
War has begun.

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:45.980
WAR FOR THE PLANET
OF THE APES

